Hello and Welcome! 

🛳️ Thank you so much for your big and detailed feedback! For the last couple of hours we read your comments to fix even a small detail to make the gameplay more enjoyable for all of you. The team has prepared a small update to the game.  

⚓ List of changes: 

 Fix to controls settings;
 Fix problem with resolution changing;
 Fix to some buttons and labels in multiple languages;
 Small tweaks with localizations;

Thank you for all your feedback and review. 💪


{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38917699/3275740acc70c627275e89ee73f2cec9575f4e27.png


Regards, 
Ship Graveyard Simulator Team

Hello Fans! 

In order not to keep you in suspense we listened to your suggestions (we really read ALL comments😎) and in the prologue we added:

 Destroying all items on the ship (e.g. furniture, cabinets);
 Attracting items from the area to the player;
 Need to learn skills to unlock master level locks;
 Tools can be selected with the 1,2,3,4,5,6 keys;
 We increased the range of tools;
 We added orders / quests;
 We fixed the "unruly" car 🙂
 You will be able to save the game in the prologue

🛳️ These are just some changes compared to the demo version. The prologue will contain much more expanded gameplay and more features, and most importantly, it will allow for a longer gameplay. Make sure to leave us a comment if you are also excited!

⚓ So stay tuned and add the prologue to your wishlist!

